HIG / a11y / units
  - Adaptive: ViewThatFits switches the controls row between HStack (macOS/regular) and VStack
    (iOS compact); ScrollView + navigationTitle scaffold; .refreshable; .task loads available signals.
  - Dynamic Type via Font.TS tokens; light/dark/high-contrast via Color.TS dynamic tokens (P2).
  - .accessibilityElement/.accessibilityLabel/.isHeader on header, panel, banner, rows; ≥44pt controls.
  - SI at the display boundary only (SignalValueFormat); LiveSignalLogDataSource is the KMP-core seam.

